/E (This model is created using the Lunchbox plugin. LunchBox is a versatile plug-in for Grasshopper, the visual programming language linked with Rhinoceros 3D, that improves parametric modelling features. LunchBox has components for creating various panelling systems, including quad grids, diamonds, and triangles.  The tool's flexibility enables quick iteration and refinement of panelling concepts, making it beneficial in both the early stages of design exploration and the more detailed development phases. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
