/K [11]
>>
endobj
178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (5. At this stage, incorporate Weaverbird features, such as Picture Frame, which creates a new mesh where each frame has a new hole in the centre.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
