286 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Kangaroo is a strong physics engine plugin for Grasshopper that is built into Rhino. It allows for interactive simulations, form-finding, optimisation, and constraint solution in the parametric design environment. Kangaroo simulates physical behaviours and forces using a particle-spring system and an energy minimisation approach. The plugin includes a solver framework and a set of Grasshopper components that enable users to design complicated simulations by combining various goals such as length constraints, point loads, and geometry constraints. Kangaroo has a wide range of applications, including structural analysis, cloth simulation, and generative design. Its flexibility and connection with Grasshopper make it a great tool for architects, engineers, and designers exploring form-finding and physics-based design solutions. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
